        {
          "type": "debt",
          "priority": "medium",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-21T12:59:20Z",
          "note": "workspace-detail.js updateStatusTable still uses row.cells[1] (hardcoded index) to find the branch cell. Now that updateRepoStatusCells exists with the CSS-class approach, updateStatusTable in workspace-detail.js is a refactor candidate: it should delegate to updateRepoStatusCells instead of duplicating the logic. This is out of scope for WP-001 but should be tracked."
        },
