          "timestamp": "2026-04-21T12:59:20Z",
          "note": "repo-status-cells.js imports showToast lazily (dynamic import inside the Git GUI click handler) to avoid a circular dependency. A cleaner approach would be to accept an optional onError callback parameter in buildRepoStatusCells so callers can inject their own error handling — this also makes unit testing the error path easier without needing a module mock."
